18. Performance Complexity
  Operation	HashMap	TreeMap
  put/get	O(1)	O(log n)
  remove	O(1)	O(log n)

19. Common Tricky Interview Questions
Q1. Why HashMap allows one null key?
Hashing logic allows it

Q2. Why TreeMap doesn’t allow null key?
Comparison causes NullPointerException

Q3. Difference between HashMap and Hashtable?
Thread-safety, performance, nulls

Q4. How HashMap avoids infinite loop (Java 8)?
Red-Black Tree instead of linked list

Q5. When to use LinkedHashMap?
When order + performance is required

